    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d800">

                <pb facs="0563" n="491" sameAs="frus:frus1865p4/pg491"/>

                <head>Polish Members of the House of Deputies</head>
                <dateline>
                    <date ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-volume-rules" calendar="gregorian"
                        notAfter="1865-07-31T23:59:59+00:53" notBefore="1865-04-15T00:00:00+00:53"
                        >undated</date>
                </dateline>
                <note rend="inline" rendition="#center" type="source">[Translation.]</note>
                <p>The Polish members of the Chamber of Deputies of Prussia, at this moment present
                    in Berlin, join their German colleagues in expressing all the grief and
                    indignation they have experienced on learning of the abominable crime to which
                    the illustrious President Lincoln has fallen a victem, a martyr of the great
                    cause of the abolition of slavery.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <list>
                            <item>AUGUSTE MIEZKOWSKI.</item>
                            <item>
                                <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dr</hi>. LIBETT.</item>
                            <item>BOGUSTAVE LUBIENSKI.</item>
                            <item>LYZBOWSKI PILASKI.</item>
                            <item>THOBAVSKI.</item>
                            <item>ZYCHLINSKI.</item>
                            <item>DAMILEWSKI.</item>
                            <item>STANISLAU MOTLEY.</item>
                            <item>LEON WEGNER.</item>
                            <item>JOSEPH POTUTICKI.</item>
                            <item>KADIMIRZ CHIAPOWSKI.</item>
                            <item>F. RESPAZDEK.</item>
                            <item>JOSEPH BOLEWSKI.</item>
                            <item>CASIMIR KANTAK.</item>
                        </list>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
